00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.880
and also a way to look for fun

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.280
and motivational activities
throughout the summer.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:13:00.020
We're hoping it's a low (murmurs).

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.830
And we're also hoping it's flexible.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.770
So if parents want to join us

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.840
for the whole time, it's great.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.860
If they wanna join us for
five weeks or three weeks,

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.297
that's totally fine too.

00:13:12.297 --> 00:13:14.960
"What age is Camp Khan for?"

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:16.430
We are targeting Camp Khan

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.810
for learners entering grades three to 12

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:19.650
'cause that's where our

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:23.100
Get ready for grade level
courses are at math.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:26.110
Now, younger students can also join us

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:29.210
for Camp Khan kids beginning July sixth.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.270
These are for students

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:32.820
who are ages two through seven.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:36.110
Again, younger kids who
might want to have that

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.340
exposure to learning activities

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.193
and fun activities this summer.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.257
Third question we've heard is,

00:13:43.257 --> 00:13:45.840
"What I have to do to
sign up and participate?"

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.946
Really signing up for Khan Academy

00:13:47.946 --> 00:13:51.300
is most of what you
need to do as a parent.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.730
Now, your child will get

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.040
these weekly notifications

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:57.740
with suggestions and recommendations

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:02.732
once they do any work on
our get ready courses.

00:14:02.732 --> 00:14:04.780
And speaking of get ready courses,

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.687
our last question is,

00:14:05.687 --> 00:14:08.950
"Which get ready course
should my child sign up for?"

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.170
I would suggest that children start

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.950
with a grade level that they're entering.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:19.950
Now, if your child is exceptional at math

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:23.010
or is really doing some advanced math,

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:26.740
they might go to a
higher grade or assembly.

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.900
If they are struggling a little bit math,

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.410
we might recommend going
in it into a lower grade.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.150
But broadly, generally speaking,

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.490
we would say the grade level course that

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.150
they should start with on get ready

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.450
is the one that we'll
be entering in the fall.

00:14:43.898 --> 00:14:46.273
All right, so we've done a few FAQ's.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:52.070
And so now we're gonna
turn it over to questions.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.810
And this is where I'm gonna
talk with Patty a little bit.

